linking your overarching strategy with specific, allowed actions.

63
00:03:05,250 --> 00:03:07,650
Step 2. You configure the exact parameters,

64
00:03:08,050 --> 00:03:10,790
dialing in the amounts, frequency, and your slippage tolerance.

65
00:03:10,790 --> 00:03:12,970
Step 3. Is the security layer,

66
00:03:13,230 --> 00:03:15,930
where the system runs protocol and specific function checks.

67
00:03:16,310 --> 00:03:17,770
Step 4. Execute.

68
00:03:18,070 --> 00:03:21,610
The automation runs, but only after passing those strict safety checks.

69
00:03:22,050 --> 00:03:23,210
And Step 5. Monitor.

70
00:03:23,530 --> 00:03:26,270
You can just sit back and watch the execution and the outcomes.

71
